	langid = {en-us},
	abstract = {We wish to test a simple hypothesis against a family of
	            alternatives indexed by a one-dimensional parameter, θ. We use a
	            test derived from the corresponding family of test statistics
	            appropriate for the case when θ is given. Davies (1977)
	            introduced this problem when these test statistics had normal
