	            of the dependent variable as regressors, high order serial
	            correlation in the disturbances is frequently a more plausible
	            alternative to the assumption of serial independence than the
	            usual first order autoregressive error model. The purpose of this
	            paper is to examine the problem of testing against general
	            autoregressive and moving average error processes. The Lagrange
